      "observed": "All four selector resistors are 0 Ω. R17 and R4 join bus pins 19 and 21 at /NET0032; R19 and R8 join bus pins 20 and 22 at /NET0041.",
      "expected": "Only the jumper appropriate to each channel and M5Stack variant should be populated; the alternate bus GPIO choices must not be shorted together.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"R17\") (value \"0\"))"
        },
